  m_Name: GItem_WheelHub
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: VoxelEngine::VoxelEngine.GridSystem.GridBlockItem
  itemId: gitem_wheelhub
  displayName: Wheel Hub
  description: 'The suspension holder for ground vehicles: armored housing, steering
    knuckle, telescopic hydraulic piston and wheel mount. Place on the underside
    or flank of a vehicle grid, then mount a modular Wheel 2x2 / 3x3 / 5x5 onto it
    (aim at the hub + RMB with the wheel in hand). Handles drive torque, braking,
    Pacejka tire grip and anti-roll pairing with the opposite hub on the same axle.
    Grind to dismount the wheel first, then the hub.'
